sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Payer as "Customer / Agent"
    participant API as "PaymentController"
    participant Orch as "PaymentOrchestrator"
    participant Idem as "IdempotencyService"
    participant Cat as "CatalogService"
    participant Fee as "FeeCalculator"
    participant Fraud as "FraudCheckChain"
    participant Wallet as "WalletService"
    participant Biller as "BillerAdapter"
    participant TN as "TopUpNet (external)"
    participant CB as "CallbackController"
    participant Sch as "Scheduler"
    participant Rec as "ReconciliationService"
    participant Notif as "NotificationService"
    participant Audit as "AuditLog"

    Note over Payer,Audit: PART 1 - Payment request (US-09 to US-13, US-15, US-18, US-19, US-29)

    Payer->>API: POST /payments (idempotencyKey, customerId, serviceId, inputValues, billAmount, agentId optional)
    Note over Payer,API: customerId is always the customer whose wallet is charged. At an agent terminal the agent supplies the customer and agentId comes from the terminal.
    API->>Orch: processPayment(request)
    Orch->>Idem: lookup(customerId, idempotencyKey, requestHash)

    alt Existing idempotencyKey with matching details
        Idem-->>Orch: existing paymentId
        Orch-->>API: current state of the original payment (no new hold, no new charge)
        API-->>Payer: 200 OK current payment status
    else Existing idempotencyKey with different details
        Idem-->>Orch: PayloadMismatch
        Orch-->>API: Refused
        API-->>Payer: 409 Request refused
    else New payment request
        Orch->>Cat: validate(serviceId, inputValues)
        Note over Cat: Service and biller must be active. All required fields must be present (meter number, phone number).

        alt Service or biller disabled, or required field missing
            Cat-->>Orch: Invalid(reason, missing field name)
            Orch-->>API: Refused (no payment is created)
            API-->>Payer: 422 Request refused naming the reason
        else Request is valid
            Cat-->>Orch: Valid(service, billerAdapter)

            Orch->>Fee: calculate(serviceId, billAmount, agentId, now)
            Note over Fee: Fixed 2.50. Percentage 1.5% rounded UP to the next piaster, min 1.00. Tiered 2.00 up to 200, 4.00 above, based on billAmount only. 0.00 if the biller has a promotion active on that Cairo day (start and end day included). Agent commission = 40% of the fee, 0.00 if the fee is 0.
            Fee-->>Orch: feeAmount, totalAmount, commissionAmount

            Orch->>Orch: Create payment in Initiated (paymentReference, amounts, commissionAmount, cairoDate) and record state history
            Orch->>Idem: store(customerId, idempotencyKey, requestHash, paymentId)
            Note over Idem: Unique (customerId, key). If two identical requests race, the second insert fails and is answered as an existing key. Kept for IDEMPOTENCY_RETENTION from config.

            rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
                Note over Orch,Wallet: Critical section: one database transaction holding a lock on the customer wallet. The limit checks and the hold are atomic, so two simultaneous payments cannot both pass.
                Orch->>Wallet: lock(customerWalletId)
                Orch->>Fraud: evaluate(customerId, totalAmount, now)
                Note over Fraud: 1) account blocked? 2) more than 5 accepted payments in a sliding 60s window (Rejected and Failed not counted)? The 6th is rejected and the account is blocked 10 minutes. 3) totalAmount (bill + fee) between 5.00 and 10000.00. 4) Cairo-day total of Completed and held payments + totalAmount within 5000 BASIC or 30000 VERIFIED.

                alt Fraud or limit check fails
                    Fraud-->>Orch: Rejected(reason)
                    Orch->>Orch: Transition Initiated -> Rejected (record history)
                    Orch->>Audit: record(actorId, PAYMENT_REJECTED, reason, now)
                    Orch-->>API: Rejected(reason)
                    API-->>Payer: 422 Rejected with clear reason (balances unchanged)
                else Checks pass
                    Fraud-->>Orch: Passed
                    Orch->>Wallet: holdFunds(customerWalletId, paymentId, totalAmount)
                    Note over Wallet: Writes HOLD ledger entry only if available balance is enough. Available balance never goes below 0.00.

                    alt Insufficient available funds
                        Wallet-->>Orch: InsufficientFunds
                        Orch->>Orch: Transition Initiated -> Rejected (record history)
                        Orch->>Audit: record(actorId, PAYMENT_REJECTED, Insufficient funds, now)
                        Orch-->>API: Rejected(Insufficient funds)
                        API-->>Payer: 422 Insufficient funds (no request is sent to the biller)
                    else Funds held
                        Wallet-->>Orch: HoldCreated
                        Orch->>Orch: Transition Initiated -> FundsHeld (record history)
                        Orch->>Audit: record(actorId, FUNDS_HELD, totalAmount, now)
                    end
                end
                Note over Orch,Wallet: Transaction commits and the wallet lock is released here.
            end

            opt Funds held (payment is FundsHeld)
                Orch->>Orch: Transition FundsHeld -> SentToBiller (record history)
                Orch->>Biller: payBill(paymentReference, serviceId, inputValues, billAmount)
                Orch->>Orch: Store request and reply in BILLER_EXCHANGES
                Note over Biller: Each biller keeps its own protocol inside its adapter. Live billers (ElectroCo, AquaCo) have a 10 second timeout. TopUpNet replies Accepted and calls back later.

                alt Biller confirms in the same request (ElectroCo, AquaCo)
                    Biller-->>Orch: Confirmed(billerReference)
                    Orch->>Orch: Transition SentToBiller -> Completed (record history)
                    Orch->>Wallet: captureAndSettle(paymentId, totalAmount, feeAmount, commissionAmount, agentId)
                    Note over Wallet: Writes CAPTURE for totalAmount. Writes FEE_INCOME = fee - commission to the SYSTEM wallet. If agentId is present, writes COMMISSION to the agent wallet.
                    Orch->>Audit: record(FUNDS_CAPTURED, FEE_CREDITED, COMMISSION_CREDITED)
                    Orch->>Notif: sendPaymentResult(customerId, paymentId, COMPLETED)
                    Note over Notif: One SMS and one Push. Failed sends are retried up to 3 times, then marked UNDELIVERED. Delivery never changes the payment state.
                    Orch-->>API: Completed
                    API-->>Payer: 200 OK Completed
                else Biller refuses the payment
                    Biller-->>Orch: Refused(failureReason)
                    Orch->>Orch: Transition SentToBiller -> Failed (record history)
                    Orch->>Wallet: releaseHold(paymentId, totalAmount)
                    Note over Wallet: Writes RELEASE ledger entry. Available balance is restored. No commission is credited.
                    Orch->>Orch: Transition Failed -> Refunded (record history)
                    Orch->>Audit: record(system, HOLD_RELEASED, totalAmount and failureReason, now)
                    Orch->>Notif: sendPaymentResult(customerId, paymentId, FAILED, failureReason)
                    Note over Notif: One SMS (with the clear failure reason) and one Push. Up to 3 retries.
                    Orch-->>API: Failed and Refunded
                    API-->>Payer: 200 Payment Failed and Refunded
                else TopUpNet replies Accepted (async biller)
                    Biller-->>Orch: Accepted(billerReference)
                    Orch->>Orch: Set acceptedAt = now. Payment STAYS in SentToBiller (not Completed).
                    Orch->>Sch: scheduleCallbackTimeout(paymentId, acceptedAt + 5 minutes)
                    Orch-->>API: Accepted, processing
                    API-->>Payer: 202 Accepted (processing)
                else Live biller does not answer within 10 seconds
                    Biller-->>Orch: Timeout
                    Orch->>Orch: Transition SentToBiller -> Unknown, set unknownAt = now (record history)
                    Note over Orch: Funds stay held, no auto-refund.
                    Orch->>Sch: scheduleRequeries(paymentId, unknownAt + 1, 5 and 15 minutes)
                    Orch->>Audit: record(system, PAYMENT_UNKNOWN, timeout, now)
                    Orch->>Notif: tell the customer the payment is being processed
                    Orch-->>API: Unknown
                    API-->>Payer: 202 Accepted (Unknown, being processed)
                end
            end
        end
    end

    Note over Payer,Audit: PART 2 - Later events that resolve a payment (US-13, US-14, US-26, US-30, US-31)

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
        Note over TN,Audit: 2A) TopUpNet callback
        TN->>CB: POST /callbacks/topupnet (externalEventId, paymentReference, status)
        CB->>CB: Save every callback as a BILLER_CALLBACKS row, even a duplicate
        CB->>Orch: applyCallback(paymentReference, status, callbackId)

        alt State is SentToBiller or Unknown and status = success
            Orch->>Orch: Transition to Completed (record history)
            Orch->>Wallet: captureAndSettle(paymentId, totalAmount, feeAmount, commissionAmount, agentId)
            Orch->>Audit: record(FUNDS_CAPTURED, FEE_CREDITED, COMMISSION_CREDITED)
            Orch->>Notif: sendPaymentResult(COMPLETED)
            Note over Orch: Callback outcome = APPLIED
        else State is SentToBiller or Unknown and status = failed
            Orch->>Orch: Transition to Failed (record history)
            Orch->>Wallet: releaseHold(paymentId, totalAmount)
            Orch->>Orch: Transition Failed -> Refunded (record history)
            Orch->>Audit: record(HOLD_RELEASED)
            Orch->>Notif: sendPaymentResult(FAILED, reason)
            Note over Orch: Callback outcome = APPLIED
        else Payment already final with the SAME result (duplicate)
            Note over Orch: Outcome = IGNORED_DUPLICATE. No state change, no second charge, no second fee credit, no second commission, no second history row.
            Orch->>Audit: record(CALLBACK_IGNORED_DUPLICATE, paymentId, now)
        else Payment already final with a CONFLICTING result
            Note over Orch: Outcome = CONFLICT_FLAGGED. State unchanged. flaggedForReview = true for support.
            Orch->>Audit: record(CALLBACK_CONFLICT, paymentId, now)
        end
        CB-->>TN: 200 OK
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
        Note over TN,Audit: 2B) No TopUpNet callback within 5 minutes
        Sch->>Orch: acceptedAt + 5 minutes reached, payment still SentToBiller
        Orch->>Orch: Transition SentToBiller -> Unknown, set unknownAt = now (record history)
        Orch->>Sch: scheduleRequeries(paymentId, unknownAt + 1, 5 and 15 minutes)
        Orch->>Audit: record(system, PAYMENT_UNKNOWN, no callback in 300 s)
        Note over Orch: Money stays held.
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
        Note over Orch,Audit: 2C) Re-queries of an Unknown payment (max 3, all measured from unknownAt)
        loop At unknownAt + 1 min, + 5 min, + 15 min
            Sch->>Orch: requery(paymentId)
            Orch->>Biller: queryStatus(paymentReference)
            Orch->>Orch: Store the reply in BILLER_EXCHANGES and increase retryCount
            alt Biller confirms
                Biller-->>Orch: Confirmed
                Orch->>Orch: Transition Unknown -> Completed
                Orch->>Wallet: captureAndSettle(...) (fee income and agent commission credited now)
                Orch->>Notif: sendPaymentResult(COMPLETED)
            else Biller refuses
                Biller-->>Orch: Refused
                Orch->>Orch: Transition Unknown -> Failed
                Orch->>Wallet: releaseHold(...)
                Orch->>Orch: Transition Failed -> Refunded
                Orch->>Notif: sendPaymentResult(FAILED, reason)
            else No clear answer
                Biller-->>Orch: Unclear or no answer
                Note over Orch: Stays Unknown, money stays held. After the 3rd re-query nothing is refunded until reconciliation.
            end
        end
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
        Note over Rec,Audit: 2D) Daily reconciliation
        Rec->>Rec: Read the biller settlement file (paymentReference, amount, status). Match each line by paymentReference.
        loop Each line and each PayLink payment of that biller and day
            alt Payment is Unknown and the file lists it as received
                Rec->>Orch: resolve(paymentId, Completed)
                Orch->>Wallet: captureAndSettle(...)
                Note over Rec: Item action = RESOLVED_COMPLETED
            else Payment is Unknown and the file does not list it
                Rec->>Orch: resolve(paymentId, Failed)
                Orch->>Wallet: releaseHold(...) then Failed -> Refunded
                Note over Rec: Item action = RESOLVED_FAILED
            else Payment is Failed or Refunded and the file lists it as received
                Note over Rec: Item saved with paymentReference, paylinkState and billerStatus. Action = FLAGGED_FOR_SUPPORT. No change to payment state or any wallet balance.
            else Other state mismatch or amount mismatch
                Note over Rec: Item saved as STATE_MISMATCH, AMOUNT_MISMATCH or MISSING_IN_PAYLINK / MISSING_IN_SETTLEMENT
            else Everything agrees
                Note over Rec: Item saved as MATCHED
            end
        end
        Rec->>Audit: record(RECONCILIATION_RUN, billerId, settlementDate)
    end
